flowchart TD
    U[User query] --> C[Coordinator]
    C --> S[(Shared State)]
    C --> R[Research Agent]
    R -->|research_results| S
    S --> A[Analyzer]
    A -->|analysis| S
    S --> W[Writer]
    W -->|draft| S
    S --> K[Critic]
    K -->|critique| S
    S --> C
    C -->|approved| F[Final answer + JSON trace]
    C -->|issues and retry available| W
    C -->|no evidence| H[Human support fallback]
